=== Stat ===
{{Green|Statistic}} bonuses will power the player up as they level up.

For every level:<br>{{DG|+}}{{Green|5}} {{stat|health}}

For every 5 levels:<br>{{DG|+}}{{Green|1}} {{stat|strength}}

